      "html": "<p>Every site inspection report has the same six parts. Use them as a free template, or take the full <a href=\"/pages/inspection-report-template-uk.html\">free inspection report template</a> for any trade.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Part</th><th>What goes in it</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>1. Header</td><td>Site and address, client, date and time, your name and role, a report reference</td></tr><tr><td>2. Scope</td><td>What you covered and what you did not</td></tr><tr><td>3. Method</td><td>Looking only, or testing too; drawings or old reports read</td></tr><tr><td>4. Findings</td><td>Place, what you saw, whether it meets the standard, a photo</td></tr><tr><td>5. Actions</td><td>What to do, who does it, by when, and a priority</td></tr><tr><td>6. Sign-off</td><td>Your signature, the date, and your qualification if the job needs it</td></tr></tbody></table>"
